      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Evidence-backed posture, never authority\nEach control is classified as **confirmed_good**, **confirmed_gap**, **unknown**, **not_applicable**, or **evidence_unavailable**. Missing or partial evidence never becomes healthy. Confirmed gaps create proposals only; this dashboard grants no remediation authority."
